'''Reba''' is a female [[Human]] [[NPC]] [[Merchant]] that can be found near the Post Office located in [[Snowhill]].

Reba sells [[Postman]] [[Job]] related [[items]], and was introduced in game on the update of October 1, 2013.
==Sells==
*[[Postman's Power Shard of Timing III]]
*[[Postman's Necklace of Timing III]]
*[[Postman's Ring of Talent III]]
*[[Certified Postman Skirt]]
*[[Certified Postman Shorts]]
*[[Certified Postman Hat]]
*[[Certified Postman Gloves]]
*[[Certified Postman Shoes]]
*[[Certified Postman Shirt]]
